{"root":"lembut","ipa":"/lɛmbut/","core":"柔软的、温和的、轻柔的","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/lɛmbut/","zh":"形容物体质地柔软，或指人的性格、声音温和、柔顺。","phrases":[{"t":"lembut hati","zh":"心肠软，心地善良"},{"t":"suara lembut","zh":"温柔的声音"},{"t":"kain yang lembut","zh":"柔软的布料"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia memiliki sifat yang sangat lembut.","zh":"他有着非常温柔的性格。"},{"t":"Bantal ini terasa sangat lembut saat disentuh.","zh":"这个枕头摸起来感觉非常柔软。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"lembut","ipa":"/lɛmbut/","zh":"柔软的，温和的","phrase":{"t":"lembut sekali","zh":"非常柔软"},"example":{"t":"Kulit bayi sangat lembut.","zh":"婴儿的皮肤非常柔软。"}},{"w":"melembutkan","ipa":"/məlɛmbutkan/","zh":"使柔软，使温和","phrase":{"t":"melembutkan hati","zh":"软化人心"},"example":{"t":"Musik ini dapat melembutkan suasana hati.","zh":"这音乐能使心情变得温和。"}},{"w":"kelembutan","ipa":"/kələmbutan/","zh":"柔软度，温柔，柔和","phrase":{"t":"kelembutan tutur kata","zh":"言语的温柔"},"example":{"t":"Dia berbicara dengan penuh kelembutan.","zh":"他说话充满了温柔。"}}],"derSlugs":["lembut","melembutkan","kelembutan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:16:28.067Z","src":"base"}